                </div>

                <!-- Filter Dropdowns -->
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-2 sm:gap-3">
                    
                    <!-- Kategori Filter -->
                    <div>
                        <select id="filterKategori" class="w-full py-2 px-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500">
                            <option value="ALL">Semua Kategori (HIV/STI/HepC)</option>
                            <option value="HIV">HIV Sahaja</option>
                            <option value="STI">STI Sahaja</option>
                            <option value="Hep C">Hepatitis C Sahaja</option>
                            <option value="Gabungan">Gabungan / Am</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Status Filter -->
                    <div>
                        <select id="filterStatus" class="w-full py-2 px-3 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal-500">
                            <option value="ALL">Semua Status (Lajur STATUS)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Reset Filters Button -->
                    <div class="col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
                        <button onclick="resetFilters()" class="w-full py-2 px-3 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 rounded-lg text-xs font-medium transition flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 border border-slate-200">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-filter-circle-xmark"></i>
                            <span>Reset Penapis</span>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Charts Grid Section -->
        <section class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
            
            <!-- Chart 1: Status Pelaksanaan Program (Doughnut) -->
            <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">Status Pelaksanaan Program</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Nisbah kemajuan program Unit</p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-pie"></i></span>
                </div>
                <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center my-auto min-h-[220px]">
                    <canvas id="statusChart"></canvas>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Chart 2: Agihan Bahagian Bertanggungjawab (Bar Chart) -->
            <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 flex flex-col justify-between">
                <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-800">Agihan Bahagian Bertanggungjawab</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500">Bilangan program mengikut bahagian / unit</p>
                    </div>
                    <span class="text-slate-400 text-sm"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-column"></i></span>
                </div>
                <div class="relative min-h-[220px]">
                    <canvas id="kategoriChart"></canvas>
                </div>
            </div>

        </section>

        <!-- Main Data Table Section -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden">
            
            <!-- Table Header Bar -->
            <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 border-b border-slate-200 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-3 bg-slate-50/50">
                <div>
                    <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-800 flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-days text-teal-600"></i>
                        Senarai Perancangan Program & Aktiviti
                    </h2>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 mt-0.5">Jadual terperinci pelan tindakan Unit HIV, STI & Hep C PKD Kepong</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2">
                    <span class="text-xs text-slate-500 font-medium" id="recordCounter">Menampilkan 0 program</span>
                    <button onclick="exportCSV()" class="px-3 py-1.5 bg-slate-200 hover:bg-slate-300 text-slate-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg transition flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-download"></i> Export CSV
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Responsive Table Wrapper -->
            <div class="overflow-x-auto">
                <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse">
                    <thead>
                        <tr class="bg-slate-100/80 text-slate-600 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wider font-bold border-b border-slate-200">
                            <th class="py-3 px-4">Nama Program / Aktiviti</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-3">Kategori</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-3">Bulan</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-3">Tarikh Mula</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-3">Tarikh Tamat</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-3">Lokasi</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-3">Yang Bertanggungjawab</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-3 text-right">Bajet (RM)</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-3 text-right">Perbelanjaan (RM)</th>
                            <th class="py-3 px-3 text-center">Status</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody id="programTableBody" class="divide-y divide-slate-200 text-xs text-slate-700">
                        <tr>
                            <td colspan="10" class="text-center py-12 text-slate-400">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-notch fa-spin text-2xl mb-2 text-teal-600"></i>
                                <p>Memuatkan jadual program...</p>
                            </td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>

        </section>

        <!-- Strategy Grid -->
        <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-teal-950 to-slate-900 rounded-xl p-5 text-white shadow-md">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-4">
                <div>
                    <h3 class="text-sm font-bold flex items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-bullhorn text-red-400"></i>
                        Fokus Utama Strategi Pelaksanaan Unit HIV/STI/Hep C PKD Kepong
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-0.5">Panduan Pelan Strategik Eliminasi HIV & Hep C Kebangsaan</p>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs">
                    <span class="bg-teal-500/20 border border-teal-400/30 text-teal-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md">Pencapaian KPI PKD</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-2 border-t border-white/10 text-xs">
                <div class="bg-white/5 p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                    <div class="font-bold text-teal-300 mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-vial-virus text-red-400"></i> Outreach & Saringan Akses Komuniti
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                        Pengukuhan saringan HIV kendiri (Self-Test), saringan STI berkala, serta ujian Point-of-Care Hepatitis C di fasiliti primer & lapangan PPR Batu Muda & Jinjang.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white/5 p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                    <div class="font-bold text-teal-300 mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-pills text-blue-400"></i> Linkage To Care & PrEP/PEP
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                        Memastikan 100% kes sah HIV dirujuk untuk rawatan ARV dalam masa &lt; 14 hari, serta pemantauan pematuhan PrEP di Klinik Kesihatan Kepong.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-white/5 p-3.5 rounded-lg border border-white/10">
                    <div class="font-bold text-teal-300 mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap text-amber-400"></i> Latihan & Advocacy Stigma Zero
                    </div>
                    <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                        Latihan berterusan kepada anggota kesihatan, rakan strategik NGO, serta advokasi kesedaran tanpa diskriminasi di fasiliti kesihatan.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <!-- Program Detail Modal -->
    <div id="detailModal" class="fixed inset-0 bg-slate-900/60 backdrop-blur-sm z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 hidden">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-slate-200 max-w-lg w-full overflow-hidden animate-fade-in">
            <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white p-5 flex items-center justify-between">
                <div>
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                        <span id="modalKategoriBadge" class="text-[10px] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-teal-600 text-white">HIV</span>
